OL,3,GNEWSAFirst 72-hour dispersal zone
OL,4,Abegins in Liverpool
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerseyside's first 72-hour dispersal
OL,7,Fzone has been introduced in part of
OL,8,FLiverpool following reports of
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FMerseyside Police said young people had
OL,12,Fbeen letting off fireworks, starting
OL,13,Ffires and intimidating residents in the
OL,14,FGarston area of south Liverpool during
OL,15,Fthe past week.
OL,17,FThe order came into force at 12:00 GMT
OL,18,Fand will remain in place until 12:00 on
OL,19,FSaturday, with extra officers deployed
OL,20,Fto the area.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
