OL,3,GNEWSAFirst 72-hour dispersal zone
OL,4,Abegins in Liverpool
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice can order people suspected of
OL,7,Fcausing - or being likely to cause -
OL,8,Fcrime, nuisance or anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour to leave a designated area
OL,10,Ffor up to 48 hours. Those who fail to
OL,11,Fcomply face being arrested.
